# foliage.fmat — the alpha cutout, as a material.
#
# The cutout threshold was a CONSTANT in fragment.glsl — 0.5, the same for every
# surface in the game — so there was nothing to author at all. As a parameter it
# is how a leaf card is made to read fatter or thinner without repainting its
# alpha.
#
# 0.5 is the level set that best reproduces a hard 0/255 silhouette once mip
# filtering has turned it into a ramp. Lower fattens the shape; higher eats it.
kind: surface
doc: A leaf card or a grate — hard silhouette, writes depth, antialiased.
effects:
  - effect: cutout
    threshold: 0.45
  - effect: smooth
